Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.06,0:00:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right now{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.93,0:00:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Never lose!\NI won't{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.06,0:00:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Just a bit more" I said{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.44,0:00:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Swinging my hopes and fists{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's not someone else's power{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.99,0:00:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Believe in your self{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.29,0:00:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The clash between strength and strength{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.76,0:00:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Has always crossed oceans and skies{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.84,0:00:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Far into space{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.05,0:00:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Rise to the front lines until the end{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.68,0:00:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With the ultimate hit{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.06,0:01:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Always in full attack{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.44,0:01:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I won't lose- I'll win!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.53,0:01:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Alright nanana{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.90,0:01:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Alright, let's get started\Non the final push!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.57,0:01:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty warrior, audacious{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.95,0:01:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I believe in my power{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.50,0:01:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right now{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.37,0:01:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Never lose!\NI won't{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.42,0:01:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Just a bit more" I said{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.88,0:01:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Swinging my hopes and fists{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.97,0:01:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All my efforts up until now{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.34,0:01:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And my frustrations fueled me{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.80,0:01:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's not someone else's power{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.14,0:01:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Believe in your self{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.69,0:01:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you fought well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You continued to surpass\Nyour own limits and grow stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.57,0:01:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You are merely a Saiyan, and yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.41,0:02:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,you caused me to use\Nthis much of my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.83,0:02:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What a splendid man!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.50,0:02:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep blabberin'\Nand you'll bite your tongue!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.15,0:02:33.45,On Top,,0,0,0,,BATTLE OF GODS
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.24,0:02:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Father's Ki!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.79,0:02:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.87,0:02:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can sense his Ki...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.54,0:02:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No... That can't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.38,0:02:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.25,0:02:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You can all sense Son Goku-san's Ki,\Nwhich means...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.63,0:02:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}he's exceeded the amount of time\Nhe can be a Super Saiyan God.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.64,0:03:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The only explanation is that\Nhe's reverted to a normal Super Saiyan.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.96,0:03:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you not get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.84,0:03:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Our party has come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.51,0:03:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Super Saiyan God powers\Nhave faded away
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.56,0:03:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and now you're just...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.48,0:03:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.52,0:03:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.20,0:03:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.57,0:03:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.53,0:04:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.03,0:04:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Super Saiyan God aura\Nhas disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.04,0:04:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You were slow to notice!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.00,0:04:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? When did that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.00,0:04:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't feel like I'm weaker at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.84,0:04:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's goin' on, Beerus-sama?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.51,0:04:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ask me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.93,0:04:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't you a god?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.89,0:04:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears your Super Saiyan God powers\Ndid not disappear due to some time limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.23,0:04:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather the power completely fused\Nwith your very being.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.94,0:04:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The god's red brilliance
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.11,0:04:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,is still burning brightly in you\Nlike a flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.16,0:04:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I mistaken?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.83,0:04:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I got no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.62,0:04:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I am me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.29,0:04:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.80,0:04:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a fool for getting all sentimental.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.42,0:05:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What's a "centi mental"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.22,0:05:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.43,0:05:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I might get infected with\Nyour stupidity if we keep talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.14,0:05:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it probably\Nrubbed off on me long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.39,0:05:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry up and keep goin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.27,0:05:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Gladly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.19,0:05:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.33,0:06:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Too easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.91,0:06:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.58,0:07:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wide open!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.00,0:07:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Right back at ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.72,0:07:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't the power of a god lie within you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.19,0:08:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you have\Nmore to offer than this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.81,0:08:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.79,0:08:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.99,0:10:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You scrape together\Nthe power of five Saiyans
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.53,0:10:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and get a patchwork-like\NSuper Saiyan God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.16,0:10:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You made it your own and perfected it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.46,0:10:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,forcing me to use\Nthis much of my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.46,0:10:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Between you and me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.67,0:10:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,For a moment, I regretted being\Nso obsessed with that prophetic dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.02,0:10:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.82,0:10:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Our battle began with this move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.79,0:11:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes indeed...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.33,0:11:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I have won.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.12,0:11:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I... ain't...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.21,0:11:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,done yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.72,0:11:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I just ended this in a super cool way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.76,0:12:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Be good and fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.93,0:12:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I... still... haven't used\Nevery ounce of my power
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.39,0:12:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,to bring you down, Beerus-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.90,0:12:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm just gonna fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.57,0:12:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Well then, try and hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.45,0:12:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We will really end it with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.68,0:12:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ka...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.06,0:12:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.77,0:12:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.15,0:12:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.57,0:12:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.86,0:14:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.29,0:14:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you really sure\Nyou're not at your limit...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.57,0:15:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Beerus-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.12,0:15:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.04,0:15:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Just 'cuz you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.46,0:15:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just 'cuz you're a god...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.76,0:15:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just go\Ndecidin' a person's limits!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.53,0:15:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the tenacity of man...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.47,0:16:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.59,0:16:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.76,0:16:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You stole my power\Nand then lost in such an unsightly way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.02,0:16:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.08,0:16:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If Son Goku won,\Nthe Earth would not be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.66,0:16:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,However, if I won...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.65,0:17:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems he's tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.99,0:17:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.91,0:17:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He usually just slacks off by\Neating, sleeping, and watching cartoons.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.70,0:17:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too much for him to just go all out\Nwithout even warming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.42,0:17:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.01,0:17:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He will probably be sleeping for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.05,0:17:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,By the time he wakes up, he'll have\Nforgotten all about destroying the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.56,0:17:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.64,0:17:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't guarantee it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.77,0:17:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.56,0:17:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudding...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.36,0:17:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think\Nhe'll forget about the pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.40,0:17:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be appreciated\Nif you had that prepared
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.15,0:17:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,for the next time we come to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.82,0:17:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fill a pool with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.33,0:18:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't allow him to tell me\Nit tastes bad after eating it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.16,0:18:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If it tastes bad,\Nhe may well indeed destroy the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.21,0:18:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoo, shoo! Go home already.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.92,0:18:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Goku-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.01,0:18:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.05,0:18:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much\Nfor playing with Beerus-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.93,0:18:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,One day, I'll return the favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.35,0:18:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.89,0:18:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then. Have a nice day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.53,0:18:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dear. This was the worst birthday ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.37,0:18:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's better to say\Nit never happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.66,0:18:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and I didn't get older this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.04,0:18:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Great job, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.96,0:18:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.92,0:18:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.43,0:18:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.80,0:18:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be a father!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.85,0:19:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Gohan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.64,0:19:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you eat lots of food, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.52,0:19:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.90,0:19:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.98,0:19:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What did becoming a god feel like?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.49,0:19:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say I became a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.53,0:19:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, can't say I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.57,0:19:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't like I got that powerful\Nall on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.79,0:19:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,On top of that, I couldn't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.29,0:19:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But, isn't Beerus-sama\Nthe strongest in the universe?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.54,0:19:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Being the second strongest is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.21,0:19:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess you're up next.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.88,0:19:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I will become stronger\Nthrough my own efforts!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.01,0:19:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The Super Saiyan God, Beerus...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.97,0:19:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And you! I shall surpass you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.94,0:19:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure are amazin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.61,0:19:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think being complimented\Nby a failure makes me happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.69,0:19:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah!\NWhen you got mad and said "My Bulma,"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.28,0:20:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,you turned into an awesome Super Saiyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.08,0:20:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I said no such thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.37,0:20:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Son, you can use Teleportation, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.25,0:20:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You were already here watching,\Nweren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.13,0:20:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My bad, my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.67,0:20:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I was observing Beerus-sama's movements\Nand workin' out a strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.63,0:20:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Couldn't come up with anythin', though!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.01,0:20:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,How long will you pretend to be asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.10,0:20:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You even made a fake snot bubble.\NThat's not like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.90,0:20:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I really was sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.57,0:20:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.24,0:20:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Earth is such a strange planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.95,0:20:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It has something mysterious about it\Nthat changed even those fiendish Saiyans.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.29,0:20:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It changed you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.37,0:20:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.58,0:20:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that was rude of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.63,0:20:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing you told Goku-san,\Nabout using 100 percent of your power
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.13,0:21:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,was just a lie to bring out\Nall of his potential, was it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.18,0:21:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.06,0:21:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That Goku. What a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.10,0:21:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He's even become friends\Nwith the God of Destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.52,0:21:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That lad really is a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.32,0:21:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He loves solitude and fighting, yet he\Ncontinues to gain more and more friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.41,0:21:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave, ho! Heave, ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.16,0:21:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let it end like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.50,0:21:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait, Dragon Balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.06,0:21:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The face of a winner{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.68,0:21:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Still hanging on, at the limit{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.52,0:21:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The paper dancing in the air\Nflashes brilliantly{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.56,0:21:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I piled up many failures along the way{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.23,0:21:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.31,0:21:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Standing tall, on my toes{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.23,0:22:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The view matters more than a sprain{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.40,0:22:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did you think sorrow could defeat me?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.99,0:22:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I eat that up, three meals a day{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.33,0:22:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A strong wind surges again{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.41,0:22:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Many troubles come my way{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.25,0:22:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Time to focus{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.34,0:22:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I swear\NI have high hopes{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.34,0:22:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll be complete in the near future{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.26,0:22:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A presence growing day by day by day{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.26,0:22:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's the proof{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.80,0:22:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My life will make sparks fly{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.01,0:22:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's nothing I can't do{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.64,0:22:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The pinnacle of perfection{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.19,0:22:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The pinnacle of perfection{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.11,0:22:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The pinnacle of perfection{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.54,0:22:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you found the Namekian survivors?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.50,0:22:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No, sir. We've had no luck as of yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.42,0:23:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.67,0:23:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.26,0:23:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to resurrect Frieza-sama
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.97,0:23:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,with my own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.35,0:23:12.64,On Top,,0,0,0,,NEXT EPISODE
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.81,0:23:15.64,On Top,,0,0,0,,RESURRECTION 'F'

